### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### USUÁRIOS
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Listar usuários
GET {{baseUrl}}/usuarios
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Listar usuários (home)
GET {{baseUrl}}/usuarios?home=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Criar usuário
POST {{baseUrl}}/usuarios
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "nome": "Novo",
  "sobrenome": "Usuário",
  "email": "novo@scardua.com.br",
  "cpf": "98765432100",
  "password": "senha123",
  "role": "user"
}

###

### Atualizar usuário (PATCH)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/usuarios
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "id": "user-uuid",
  "action": "update",
  "email": "email@novo.com"
}

###

### Excluir usuário
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/usuarios
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "id": "user-uuid"
}

###

### Permissões de um usuário (GET)
GET {{baseUrl}}/usuarios/permissions?userId=user-uuid
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Definir permissão de uma página (POST)
POST {{baseUrl}}/usuarios/permissions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "userId": "user-uuid",
  "page": "colaboradores",
  "canAccess": true,
  "canEdit": false,
  "canDelete": false
}

###

### Atualizar múltiplas permissões
POST {{baseUrl}}/usuarios/updatepermissions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "userId": "user-uuid",
  "permissions": {
    "colaboradores": { "canAccess": true, "canEdit": true, "canDelete": false },
    "contratos": { "canAccess": true, "canEdit": false, "canDelete": false }
  }
}

###

### Todas as permissões (admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/usuarios/all-permissions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Check permission
GET {{baseUrl}}/usuarios/checkpermission?page=colaboradores
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

